 linux-headers-amd64 [amd64] | linux-headers-arm64 [arm64] | linux-headers-generic
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://etherlab.org/ethercat

Package: libethercat
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: IgH EtherCAT Master userspace library
 Open-source EtherCAT master implementation for Linux.
 This package provides the libethercat shared library and
 development files (headers, static library, pkg-config,
 and CMake module) used by applications that talk to the
 running EtherCAT master.

Package: ethercat-master
Architecture: any
Depends: libethercat (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, lsb-base
Recommends: ethercat-dkms
Description: IgH EtherCAT Master userspace tools and service
 Open-source EtherCAT master implementation for Linux.
 This package provides the ethercat command-line tool,
 ethercatctl, the init script, sysconfig defaults and
 the systemd service unit.

Package: ethercat-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1), autoconf, automake, libtool, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ethercat-master
Description: IgH EtherCAT Master kernel modules (DKMS)
 Source for the IgH EtherCAT master and native Ethernet
 driver kernel modules, built via DKMS against the running
 kernel. Equivalent to the openSUSE kernel-module package.
